# Test scene to verify SOLID materials don't reflect other objects

# Ambient light 
A					0.4					255,255,255

# Camera 
C 	0,0,5						0,0,-1	70

# Light source
L 	3,3,3				0.7				255,255,255

# SOLID sphere (should not reflect the metal sphere)
sp 	0,0,0		    1.2 						200,100,100		SOLID

